         <p class="oj-note">
            <a id="ntr2-L_2012234EN.01000401-E0002" href="#ntc2-L_2012234EN.01000401-E0002"
               >(<span class="oj-super">2</span>)</a>  
            <a href="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/oj/JOL_2010_302_R_TOC"
               >OJ L 302, 18.11.2010, p. 1</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <hr class="oj-doc-sep"/>
      <div id="L_2012234EN.01000601">
         <div class="eli-container" id="anx_1">
            <p class="oj-doc-ti" id="d1e32-6-1">ANNEX</p>
            <p class="oj-normal">In Annex III to Regulation (EU) No 1031/2010, the table is replaced by the following:</p>
            <div>
               <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="oj-table">
                  <col width="16%"/>
                  <col width="35%"/>
                  <col width="48%"/>
                  <tbody>
                     <tr>
                        <td colspan="3" >
                           <p class="oj-tbl-hdr">‘<span class="oj-bold">Auction platforms appointed by Germany</span>
                           </p>
                        </td>
                     </tr>
                     <tr/>
                     <tr class="oj-table">
                        <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                           <p class="oj-tbl-txt">1</p>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                           <p class="oj-tbl-txt">Auction Platform</p>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                           <p class="oj-tbl-txt">European Energy Exchange AG (EEX)</p>
                        </td>
                     </tr>
                     <tr class="oj-table">
                        <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                           <p class="oj-normal"> </p>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                           <p class="oj-tbl-txt">Term of appointment</p>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                           <p class="oj-tbl-txt">From 1 September 2012 at the earliest until at least 31 March 2013 and 31 December 2013 at the latest, without prejudice to the second subparagraph of Article 30(5).</p>
                        </td>
                     </tr>
                     <tr class="oj-table">
                        <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                           <p class="oj-normal"> </p>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                           <p class="oj-tbl-txt">Conditions</p>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                           <p class="oj-tbl-txt">Admission to the auctions shall not be dependent on becoming a member of or a participant in the secondary market organised by EEX or of any other trading place operated by EEX or by any third party.</p>
                        </td>
                     </tr>
                     <tr class="oj-table">
                        <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                           <p class="oj-normal"> </p>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                           <p class="oj-tbl-txt">Obligations</p>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="top" class="oj-table"  >
                           <p class="oj-tbl-txt">Within two months from 1 September 2012, EEX shall submit its exit strategy to Germany for consultation of the auction monitor.</p>
                           <p class="oj-tbl-txt">Within two months from receiving the auction monitor’s opinion, EEX shall review its exit strategy, taking the utmost account of that opinion.</p>
                           <p class="oj-tbl-txt">Germany shall notify the Commission of any substantive changes in relevant contractual relations with EEX.’</p>
                        </td>
                     </tr>
                  </tbody>
               </table>
            </div>
         </div>
      </div>
      <hr class="oj-doc-end"/>
